WEBVTT

00:00:06.583 --> 00:00:08.291
-[grunts]
-[buzzer sounds]

00:00:09.916 --> 00:00:11.208
[audience cheering]

00:00:11.291 --> 00:00:13.166
[all] Awooga! [chuckling]

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:14.708
[all] Awooga!

00:00:14.791 --> 00:00:16.125
Yeah,
that's what I'm talking about!

00:00:16.208 --> 00:00:17.916
Look at that! That's my girl!

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.166
[female announcer]
And the Foghorns

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:20.833
win the championship!

00:00:20.916 --> 00:00:21.916
[all cheering]

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:25.083
[cheering]

00:00:26.416 --> 00:00:28.291
-She shoots and she scores!
-Champions, baby!

00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:29.458
[woman] Hey, girls.

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:31.291
Congratulations on your win.

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:33.833
-That's the high school coach!
-[both exclaiming]

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:35.416
What a game!

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.166
That last play? Whoo!

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.250
The three of you
were impressive.

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:40.625
Thanks, Coach Roberts.

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:42.000
Look, it's last minute,

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:45.041
but every year,
I do a three-day skills camp.

00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:46.958
I invite all the best players
in the area.

00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:49.041
I'd love
for you girls to come.

00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:51.208
Are we in a dream right now?

00:00:51.291 --> 00:00:52.833
Please, can somebody pinch me?

00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:53.916
Ow!

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.125
Definitely awake.

00:00:55.208 --> 00:00:56.541
If we impress Coach,

00:00:56.625 --> 00:00:58.375
she'll put the three of us
on the team next year.

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:00.166
Ooh! The Fire Hawks!

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.000
Finally,
a team I can get behind.

00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:04.250
What do you say?

00:01:04.333 --> 00:01:05.333
-Yes!
-Absolutely yes.

00:01:05.416 --> 00:01:06.541
-We're there!
-Thank you,

00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:07.666
-thank you, thank you!
-Great.

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:08.958
We'll see you tomorrow.

00:01:09.416 --> 00:01:10.791
Ah! This is amazing!

00:01:10.958 --> 00:01:12.250
[all laughing]

00:01:15.291 --> 00:01:16.416
[knocking at door]

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.166
-What a big day!
-[exclaims]

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.708
You are such an all-star!

00:01:19.791 --> 00:01:22.083
You are gonna knock
the coach's skates off!

00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:24.333
Hockey scholarship,
here we come!

00:01:24.416 --> 00:01:25.416
Dad, stop.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.166
It's just hockey camp.

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:29.375
I mean,
who knows what'll happen?

00:01:32.291 --> 00:01:34.083
-[referee blows whistle]
-Twenty-eight. Andersen,

00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:35.250
-tripping.
-[Sadness whimpering]

00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:38.125
My penalty almost lost us
the game today.

00:01:38.208 --> 00:01:40.208
What if I get to camp
and I screw it up?

00:01:40.291 --> 00:01:41.708
Hey, don't talk like that.

00:01:41.791 --> 00:01:43.916
Yeah,
you did great today, honey.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.916
Exactly. Mom gets it.

00:01:46.333 --> 00:01:47.750
Yeah, I guess.

00:01:47.916 --> 00:01:49.708
We're so proud of you.

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:51.583
Night, monkey.
[mimics chittering]

00:01:51.666 --> 00:01:53.125
-[mimics chittering, laughs]
-All right, all right.

00:01:53.208 --> 00:01:54.458
Sleep tight, honey.

00:01:54.541 --> 00:01:55.541
[door closes]

00:01:56.875 --> 00:01:57.875
[sighs]

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.833
Oh, Riley's so hard
on herself.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.958
But we can make
everything easier.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:06.625
[grunts]

00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:09.000
Behold, my super high-tech

00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:11.333
-Riley protection system.
-[clangs]

00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:13.916
Don't look, it's fine.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.708
This is for all those memories

00:02:15.791 --> 00:02:17.833
that belong
in the Back of the Mind,

00:02:17.916 --> 00:02:19.583
like this penalty one.

00:02:19.666 --> 00:02:22.416
It's weighing on her,
so let's lighten the load.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.291
A one-way expressway to,

00:02:24.458 --> 00:02:27.083
"We're not gonna think
about that right now." Whoo!

00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:31.125
-[Anger] Not bad.
-[Sadness] Oh, Joy.

00:02:31.208 --> 00:02:32.416
-That's pretty impressive.
-You worked hard.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.666
You take such good care
of Riley.

00:02:34.833 --> 00:02:36.291
Thanks, I try.

00:02:36.375 --> 00:02:37.750
Okay, let's do a sweep.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.125
Oh, here's one
where she waved at a guy

00:02:40.208 --> 00:02:42.416
who was actually waving
at a girl behind her.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.625
Oh, that was so bad.
Good choice.

00:02:44.708 --> 00:02:47.333
Oh, here's when she forgot
that girl's name.

00:02:47.416 --> 00:02:48.458
Oh, yeah,
that was super awkward.

00:02:48.541 --> 00:02:49.541
What was her name?

00:02:49.625 --> 00:02:50.708
I don't know,
Janet or something?

00:02:50.791 --> 00:02:52.458
Whatever. Let's just
get rid of it. Oh! [chuckles]

00:02:53.041 --> 00:02:57.041
We keep the best
and toss the rest. [sighs]

00:02:57.125 --> 00:02:58.375
Nice work, everyone.

00:02:58.458 --> 00:02:59.458
All right, Anger,

00:02:59.541 --> 00:03:01.125
the rest of these babies
can go to long-term.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.166
Oh, okay.
Let's get some shut-eye.

00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:11.791
Big day tomorrow.

00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:20.750
Joy, are you taking that

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:23.291
where I think
you're taking that?

00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:25.583
-Wanna come this time?
-Yes.

00:03:25.666 --> 00:03:26.666
I mean no. I...

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:29.208
Oh, no. I really shouldn't.

00:03:29.291 --> 00:03:30.458
You know, you're the only one

00:03:30.541 --> 00:03:32.250
who hasn't been
to the Belief System.

00:03:32.333 --> 00:03:33.791
Yeah, it's just that it's new,

00:03:33.875 --> 00:03:35.666
and I know
how important it is.

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:38.958
And I don't wanna mess it up
or break it,

00:03:39.041 --> 00:03:41.416
or burn it to the ground
or anything.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.000
Sadness, you won't hurt it,
I promise.

00:03:44.083 --> 00:03:45.625
Have I ever
steered you wrong before?

00:03:45.708 --> 00:03:47.583
Yeah, many times.

00:03:47.666 --> 00:03:48.791
Come on.

00:03:48.875 --> 00:03:50.041
[panel chimes]

00:03:50.125 --> 00:03:52.333
Where I go, you go.

00:03:58.416 --> 00:04:00.416
[♪ enchanting music playing]

00:04:11.541 --> 00:04:12.541
[elevator dings]

00:04:16.583 --> 00:04:19.416
[gasps] Oh, my goodness.

00:04:21.541 --> 00:04:23.541
[♪ gentle piano music playing]

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.250
[splashing]

00:04:38.666 --> 00:04:40.291
Whoa!

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:51.500
[cord reverberates]

00:04:51.583 --> 00:04:53.583
[young Riley echoing]
Mom and Dad are proud of me.

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:55.375
Ah! An oldie but a goodie.

00:04:57.708 --> 00:04:58.750
[Young Riley] [Riley]
[echoing] I'm kind.

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:01.208
Aw. That's nice.

00:05:02.958 --> 00:05:04.416
[Riley echoing]
I'm strong. I'm brave.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:05.958
I'm a really good friend.

00:05:06.041 --> 00:05:07.083
[chuckles softly]

00:05:09.458 --> 00:05:10.791
[muffled laughter]

00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:24.125
[reverberates]

00:05:24.208 --> 00:05:25.625
[Riley echoing]
I'm a winner.

00:05:25.708 --> 00:05:28.041
[Joy] And all those beliefs
come together

00:05:28.125 --> 00:05:30.458
to make our Riley.

00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:32.041
[Riley] I'm a good person.

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:38.375
-[Joy snoring]
-[Anger mumbling]

00:05:42.625 --> 00:05:43.666
[Joy chuckles]

00:05:44.208 --> 00:05:45.333
[distinct beep]

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.458
[chuckles, snores]

00:05:49.083 --> 00:05:50.166
-[distinct beep]
-[mumbles]

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.333
[continues snoring]

00:05:54.416 --> 00:05:55.625
-[distinct beep]
-Huh?

00:05:56.041 --> 00:05:57.041
[groaning]

00:05:57.125 --> 00:05:59.708
-What the heck is that?
-[distinct beep]

00:06:06.041 --> 00:06:07.041
[beeps]

00:06:07.625 --> 00:06:08.791
[groans softly]

